  "sourceTitle": "Pumpkin-Gingersnap Milkshake",
  "sourceText": "Pumpkin-Gingersnap Milkshake\nBy: Sommer\nPublished: Thursday, October 7, 2010 - 7:38am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n cup pumpkin puree\n1 tablespoon brown sugar\n1 teaspoon pumpkin pie spice\n2 LARGE scoops vanilla ice cream\n8 broken gingersnap cookies\n cup milk\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Puree all the ingredients in the blender until smooth. 2 Garnish with extra cookies pieces or pepitas (pumpkin seeds).\n\nAbout\n\n\nThis is fantastic treat to get you into the fall spirit! Add 1 teaspoon of finely ground coffee for a java-squash milkshake!",
